<title>USA: Banyan Systems names Spaulding CFO.</title>
<headline>Banyan Systems names Spaulding CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Systems Inc said Thursday it named Richard Spaulding as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Spaulding was formerly vice president of finance and treasurer of Banyan. He joined the company in 1990.</p>
